flowchart TB
  Browser[Browser / CDN] --> Web[Next.js em container OCI no Cloud Run]
  Web --> API[Backend em container OCI no Cloud Run]
  API --> Auth[Identity Platform ou provedor aprovado]
  API --> DB[(Cloud SQL PostgreSQL HA)]
  API --> Obj[Cloud Storage]
  Browser --> CDN[Cloud CDN / imagens otimizadas]
  Obj --> CDN
  API --> Tasks[Cloud Tasks / Pub/Sub]
  Tasks --> Jobs[Workers de expiração e notificação]
  Jobs --> DB
  Jobs --> Mail[Provedor de e-mail]
  Jobs --> SMS[Provedor SMS]
  API --> Translate[Cloud Translation API]
  API --> Secrets[Secret Manager]
  API --> Obs[Logging / Monitoring / Error Reporting]
